Spelunkery for Sunrise (version 0.1.0)

A port of Spelunkery 1.20.1-0.3.16 (Fabric) by Ordana and Keybounce, with contributions from Bobisnotaperson,
ElBones, Nerjal Nosk, ChromaPIE and Mikeliro (fabric.mod.json).
Original source: https://github.com/AstralOrdana/Spelunkery
Homepage: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spelunkery
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-only ("LGPLv3" in fabric.mod.json)

Content (blocks, items, textures, models, sounds, loot, recipes, tags, worldgen) is carried over from the original
and converted to 26.3's formats by lavoide; the rules are written in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API by arismoko.
This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0-only); the licence text is in LICENSE, and
COPYING is the GNU GPL v3 text the LGPL builds on. icon.png is made from the mod's own item textures.

